# Whitelist: anything not listed here stays out of the build context, so a file
# that exists on one machine only can never change the build. .cargo/config.toml
# is the concrete case — it pins PHP_CONFIG to a local path, and cargo applies
# non-forced [env] entries whenever the variable is unset.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!src
!crates

# Re-excluded after the whitelist: build output lives inside the trees above.
**/target
